WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.710
Healthcare-provider path.

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:09.235
Only the HCP-labelled path includes a carotid pulse check together with breathing for no more than 10 seconds.

00:00:09.235 --> 00:00:16.691
If there is no definite pulse or there is doubt, the trained provider assumes arrest and starts compressions.

00:00:16.691 --> 00:00:20.248
The lay path does not ask learners to check a pulse.
